Procedure: connect Cursor
Copy the Cursor snippet from the MCP page (or use the JSON below) and authenticate with a workspace API key from **Settings → API Keys**.
Copy the MCP server URL
Expand the **Cursor** integration card. Copy the `mcpServers.dataflow.url` value shown for your tenant.
Where: System → MCP → Cursor
Paste into Cursor Settings → MCP
Add the server entry, restart MCP if prompted, then call governed tools (connectors, preflight, jobs). Every agent-initiated transfer appears in **Job Theater** with an audit trail.
Where: Cursor → Settings → MCP
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "dataflow": {
      "url": "https://api.datawrap.io/api/v1/mcp"
    }
  }
}
